    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send offer e-mail\nCalled by the app only when the owner presses **Одобри и изпрати на клиента** in the admin inbox:\n`{ requestId, to, subject, body }` -> `{ sent: true }`.\n\n**Build branded e-mail** escapes the owner's text and wraps it in the site's design (carbon background, rust accent). To change colours, the site address or the footer text, edit the constants at the top of that node.\n\nThis webhook sends real e-mails, so it only accepts calls that carry the `x-webhook-secret` header (value of `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` in .env).\n\nIf Gmail fails, the app gets an error and tells the owner the e-mail was NOT sent.",
